content.text:
**Root cause:** After Armenia was added as a custom country, `/api/countries` sorts alphabetically after `all`. `loadCountries` skipped `all` and picked the first real country → **Armenia**. The first board load then wrote that into `localStorage`, so new users landed on an empty board.

**Fix:**
1. Default to **All countries** when there’s no URL/saved preference
2. Bump the storage key to `country_v2` so anyone already stuck on Armenia gets a one-time reset to All

```44:47:relocation_jobs/static/js/data.js
